          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achiulavya mudzi wa Lakishi mikononi mwa Iziraeli, nao siku ya phiri achiuteka na achiolaga atu osi ariokala mo mudzini, dza viratu arivyokala akauhenda mudzi wa Libuna.",
          "type": "text",
