              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho mfalume Horamu wa Gezeri wakpwedzaterya atu a Lakishi ela iye achiolagbwa phamwenga na jeshire ni Joshuwa, wala taphana yesala.",
          "type": "text",
