          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "auteka nyo mudzi, achiushambuliya kpwa upanga phamwenga na mfalumewe na vidzidzivye na achiangamiza chila mutu bila kusaza hata mmwenga, dza viratu arivyohendera mudzi wa Egiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
