          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Joshuwa wateka tsi zosi arizoshinda, afalume a seemu za myangoni, seemu za Negebu, seemu za kugbwa na seemu za mavoromoko phamwenga na afalume aho naye waangamiza bila kusaza hata mmwenga ariyekala anaphuma kama Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Aiziraeli arivyolagiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshuwa waashinda kula Kadeshi-Barinea hadi Gaza na tsi ya Gosheni kufikira Gibioni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joshuwa washinda afalume osi na tsi zao charo chimwenga kpwa sababu Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli waapigania. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
